=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最终产品关税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是中间投入的关税率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是中间投入在最终产品价值中的比重。</p>\n<p>关键启示：如果中间投入的关税高于最终产品的关税，有效保护率可能为负——关税结构反而惩罚了下游产业。这在发展中国家的&quot;关税升级&quot;（tariff escalation）问题中尤为突出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"非关税壁垒\">非关税壁垒</h3><p>现代贸易保护越来越多地使用非关税壁垒（NTBs）：</p>\n<p><strong>进口配额</strong>：直接限制进口数量。\n<strong>自愿出口限制</strong>（VER）：出口国&quot;自愿&quot;限制出口量以避免更严厉的进口限制。1980年代日本对美国的汽车VER是典型案例。\n<strong>技术性贸易壁垒</strong>（TBT）：以安全、健康或环境标准为名的进口限制。\n<strong>卫生与植物检疫措施</strong>（SPS）：以食品安全为由的进口限制。\n<strong>反倾销税</strong>：当外国企业被认定以低于&quot;正常价值&quot;的价格出口时，进口国可以征收额外关税。反倾销是当代最常用的贸易保护工具之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保护主义的政治经济学\">保护主义的政治经济学</h3><p>既然关税造成净福利损失，为什么各国仍然广泛使用？答案在于贸易政策的政治经济学。</p>\n<p><strong>集中收益vs分散成本</strong>：关税使少数受保护产业获得集中的巨大收益，而成本（消费者支付更高价格）分散在广大消费者中。每个消费者的损失很小，缺乏组织起来反对的动机。受保护产业则有强大的游说动机和资源。</p>\n<p><strong>格罗斯曼-赫尔普曼模型</strong>（1994）将贸易政策建模为政府在社会福利和利益集团政治贡献之间的权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = aW + \\sum C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">aW</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>政府最大化加权目标函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是社会福利，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各利益集团的政治贡献。有组织的利益集团获得正保护，没有组织的行业获得负保护（被隐性征税）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幼稚产业保护的争论\">幼稚产业保护的争论</h3><p>亚历山大·汉密尔顿和弗里德里希·李斯特最早系统阐述了幼稚产业保护论：新兴产业在初期无法与已有国际竞争者抗衡，暂时的保护可以让它们沿学习曲线下降，最终具备国际竞争力。</p>\n<p>有效的幼稚产业保护需要满足穆勒-巴斯塔布尔标准：保护期间的净现值损失应小于产业成熟后带来的净现值收益。实践中的困难在于：政府能否正确识别有潜力的幼稚产业？保护一旦建立，受保护产业会游说使保护永久化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某国进口某商品，世界价格为100元/单位。征收20%的从价税后，国内产量从80万单位增加到100万单位，消费量从150万单位减少到130万单位。计算消费者剩余变化、生产者剩余变化、关税收入和净福利损失。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>最终产品的关税率为10%，其主要中间投入占产品价值的60%，中间投入的关税率为5%。计算有效保护率。如果中间投入的关税提高到15%呢？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么反倾销措施被批评为&quot;合法的保护主义&quot;？倾销的认定标准有哪些问题？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>中美贸易摩擦中，美国对中国商品征收高关税。从福利分析角度，谁承担了这些关税的成本？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>道格拉斯·欧文的《贸易冲突：美国贸易政策的历史》追溯了美国从建国至今的贸易政策演变。巴格瓦蒂和帕纳格里亚的《为什么自由贸易是正确的》从理论和实证角度为自由贸易辩护。</p>\n<p>克鲁格曼、奥布斯特费尔德和梅利兹《国际经济学》第9-12章对贸易政策的福利分析和政治经济学有详尽的阐述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>关税和配额是最基本的贸易保护工具。小国关税产生无谓损失但不能改善贸易条件，大国关税可能通过改善贸易条件获益但面临报复风险。有效保护率揭示了关税结构的真实保护效果。贸易保护的存在更多是政治经济学而非经济效率的产物。理解贸易壁垒的福利效应，是评判贸易政策和参与贸易谈判的必备知识。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关税与配额","id":"关税与配额"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"大国关税的最优关税论","id":"大国关税的最优关税论"},{"level":3,"text":"有效保护率","id":"有效保护率"},{"level":3,"text":"非关税壁垒","id":"非关税壁垒"},{"level":3,"text":"保护主义的政治经济学","id":"保护主义的政治经济学"},{"level":3,"text":"幼稚产业保护的争论","id":"幼稚产业保护的争论"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"新贸易理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-theory/new-trade-theory"},"next":{"title":"贸易协定","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/international-trade/trade-policy/trade-agreements"}}